-2012:p0374:b003:l021","ordinal":322020,"en":"You've done your best,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l022","ordinal":322021,"en":"He was like a dragon"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l023","ordinal":322022,"en":"The fame was given by blue"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l024","ordinal":322023,"en":"You made a slave by stomping on your feet."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l025","ordinal":322024,"en":"You made your bloodless brother blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l026","ordinal":322025,"en":"The settlement of the river is fat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l027","ordinal":322026,"en":"Slow everything down,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l028","ordinal":322027,"en":"The river is a wide settlement"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l029","ordinal":322028,"en":"You've got a crowd pleaser."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l030","ordinal":322029,"en":"Measured against the whip,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l031","ordinal":322030,"en":"You took the land left by Baba."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l032","ordinal":322031,"en":"You diverted the water of the river,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l033","ordinal":322032,"en":"It's a good thing to do to yourself"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l034","ordinal":322033,"en":"You hit like a mountain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l035","ordinal":322034,"en":"Couldn't fit into a century,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l036","ordinal":322035,"en":"Don't lie on the ground"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l037","ordinal":322036,"en":"You insulted me in Chinese."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l038","ordinal":322037,"en":"Where is the hero, where is the man,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l039","ordinal":322038,"en":"Where is Karan, where is the waist,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0374:b003:l040","ordinal":322039,"en":"What's the use in mourning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l001","ordinal":322040,"en":"I won't eat if I put too much,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l002","ordinal":322041,"en":"Don't come near, crazy slave"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l003","ordinal":322042,"en":"If I'm really angry, I won't hold back."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l004","ordinal":322043,"en":"If I get angry and scream,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l005","ordinal":322044,"en":"I will make you interesting."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l006","ordinal":322045,"en":"By chance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l007","ordinal":322046,"en":"I will probably swallow it too."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l008","ordinal":322047,"en":"My name is Kanchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0375:b002:l009","ordinal":322048,"en":"Six field stages,"}]
